---
import BaseLayout from '@/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
import MarketingHero from '@/components/layout/MarketingHero.astro';
import HomePageFooter from '@/components/home/HomePageFooter.astro';
import { marketingPageLayout } from '@/lib/marketing-page';
import Section from '@/components/layout/Section.astro';
import Container from '@/components/layout/Container.astro';
import CtaBlock from '@/components/ui/CtaBlock.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Wellness First Global handles your information, email, and quiet attention."
  canonicalPath="/legal/privacy"
  {...marketingPageLayout}
>
  <MarketingHero
    legal
    compact
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy"
    description="A plain-language summary of what we collect, why, and what we refuse to do with it. We believe privacy is part of care."
  />
  <Section tone="default" spacing="comfortable" class="!pt-0">
    <Container narrow>
      <div class="max-w-prose-wfg space-y-3 text-ink-600">
        <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl text-ink-800 first:mt-0">What we collect</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          When you join the interest list, contact the desk, or request a consult, you may give us your name, email and a short message. We do not ask for more than we need to answer you well.
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl text-ink-800">Your account</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          When you create an account we store your name, your email address, whether you would like our occasional notes, and the date you agreed to these statements. Your password is handled by our sign-in provider and stored only as a secure hash; we never see it. While you are signed in, a small sign-in token is kept in your browser so you stay signed in.
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl text-ink-800">Birth details and Life Rhythm</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Life Rhythm works out your chart in your browser and keeps your birth details there. If you are signed in and tick the box to save them to your account, we store your date, time and place of birth (with its coordinates and time zone), the name you give the profile, and the date you agreed. Only you can read them. If you change them we keep each earlier version, so programs made from it still play the same. We use them only to show Life Rhythm on your devices and to put together your personal Wellness Waves programs, never for advertising and never shared with anyone else. You can remove them in Life Rhythm at any time, and they are deleted with your account. Programs you already have stay playable but are no longer linked to your details.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          When you search for a birthplace, the text you type is sent to Open-Meteo’s place search to find its coordinates. Nothing else about you is sent with it.
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl text-ink-800">Wellness Waves</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          You can listen without an account. Then your player settings, favourites and listening history stay in your browser and are never sent to us.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          When you are signed in, we keep these so they follow you across devices: your favourites and recently played soundscapes, your sound and program settings, and a listening log (which soundscape and program played, when, for how long, how it ended, and the kind of device, such as phone or desktop). We use the log to keep your history and to understand, in total, which sounds people use. We do not sell it or use it for advertising.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Your personal programs (“For you”) are put together on our server from your saved birth details and the date. We store each program we make for you, with its name, description and exact frequencies, so that a saved program plays the same a year from now. Only you can see your programs and saves. If you open “For you” without saved details, the player sends the birth details kept in your browser to our server to put your programs together; they are used for that request only and not stored.
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl text-ink-800">How we use it</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          We use this information to reply to you, to run your account, Life Rhythm and Wellness Waves, to schedule or route consult conversations, and, only if you have agreed, to send community updates. We do not sell, rent or trade personal data. We do not use dark patterns to keep you enrolled.
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl text-ink-800">Who helps us</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          A few service providers process data on our behalf, only to run the site: Supabase (our database and sign-in, hosted in the EU, London region), Vercel (hosting and privacy-friendly page statistics), Resend (account and notification emails) and Open-Meteo (birthplace search). They may not use your data for their own purposes.
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl text-ink-800">Cookies &amp; analytics</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          We use only what the site needs to work, such as keeping you signed in and remembering your player settings in your browser. For page statistics we use Vercel Web Analytics, which counts visits in aggregate without cookies and without following you across other sites. We run no advertising trackers.
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl text-ink-800">How long we keep it</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          We keep correspondence long enough to serve you and meet reasonable obligations, then delete or archive it with care. Account data, saved birth details, player settings, the listening log and your programs are kept while your account exists and are deleted with it. We may remove older daily programs you never saved or played. You can leave our notes list at any time.
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl text-ink-800">Your choices and rights</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          You can ask us for a copy of your data, ask us to correct or delete it, withdraw a consent you gave (such as saving your birth details), or object to how we use it. To delete your account and everything linked to it, write to us; a delete button in My Wellness Space is on its way. If you are in the EU or UK, you can also complain to your local data protection authority.
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl text-ink-800">Questions</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          For privacy questions, write to{' '}
          <a class="link-wfg" href="mailto:hello@wellnessfirstglobal.com?subject=Privacy%20inquiry">hello@wellnessfirstglobal.com</a>
          with “Privacy” in the subject line.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-ink-500">Last updated: November 2026. We will note substantive changes on this page.</p>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </Section>
  <Section tone="contrast" spacing="comfortable" class="!pt-0">
    <Container>
      <CtaBlock
        id="privacy-cta"
        title="Prefer a single thread"
        body="For privacy or data questions, you can also use the contact form—we will route it to the same small desk that reads mail."
        href="/contact"
        label="Go to contact"
        variant="secondary"
      />
    </Container>
  </Section>
  <HomePageFooter slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
